-> intro
=== intro ===
You face the being that is responsible for the missing inidividuals.
It's very presence displays authority.
Your body starts to weaken.
As you try to fight back, you remember the amulet your picked up earlier.
You remember how it shimmered after touching the magic water.
As you bring the amulet up to the being,
It screams,
Then fades away.
The being is no more.
It is over.
The people are saved.
->END